{"files": [{"id": 47099638, "name": "ppat.1011970.s001.eps", "size": 2210974, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/47099638", "supplied_md5": "421cff172684effe542020e3d6986149", "computed_md5": "421cff172684effe542020e3d6986149", "mimetype": "image/x-eps"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 4308, "full_name": "Yan Chen", "first_name": "Yan", "last_name": "Chen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Yan_Chen", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841048, "full_name": "Rodney P. Kincaid", "first_name": "Rodney P.", "last_name": "Kincaid", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841051, "full_name": "Kelley Bastin", "first_name": "Kelley", "last_name": "Bastin", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841054, "full_name": "Devin N. Fachko", "first_name": "Devin N.", "last_name": "Fachko", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 18841057, "full_name": "Rebecca L. Skalsky", "first_name": "Rebecca L.", "last_name": "Skalsky", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/S1_Fig_-/26051905", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>A. Volcano plot from the CRISPR/Cas9 screen. A total of 479 cellular miRNAs with confirmed expression in MutuI cells (by miRNA sequencing) are represented. For each miRNA, the x-axis shows the enrichment in anti-IgM treated gp350-positive or gp350-negative MutuI cells (average Fold Change (FC)) calculated from the mean of all four gRNAs targeting a given miRNA. The y-axis shows statistical significance. Highlighted in red are the 17 miRNAs significantly enriched in gp350-positive cells and the 22 miRNAs significantly enriched in the gp350-negative cells. B. EBV genomic DNA levels were determined by qPCR using primers to the LMP1 region. Genomic DNA was isolated using DNAzol from MutuI cells transduced with control (Neg3) or two different miR-142 gRNAs (#10024 or #10033). Values are normalized to GAPDH and reported relative to levels in control cells. C. miR-142-3p and miR-142-5p expression. Total RNA was isolated from MutuI cells transduced with control (Neg3) or two different miR-142 gRNAs (#10024 or #10033). miRNAs were assayed by Taqman qRT-PCR. Values are normalized to miR-16 and shown relative to Neg3 control cells. Shown is the average of three independent experiments. D. through F. Sequences of the miR-142 precursor in IBL-1, BL41, Ramos, BJAB, MutuI, and Akata cell lines. The MIR142 locus was PCR amplified from genomic DNA isolated from cells and sequencing by Sanger sequencing. Single nucleotide variations are denoted in red. G. Consensus sequences of the two miR-142 mutant cell lines (10024.C19 and 10033.23). Sequences of the controls (Neg3.C4 and Neg3.C2) are shown for comparison. miR-142-5p and miR-142-3p mature sequences are highlighted above.</p> <p>(EPS)</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 2210974, "created_date": "2024-06-17T17:37:19Z", "modified_date": "2024-06-28T17:35:33Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["b cell receptor", "surface ig cross", "xlink \"> reactivation", "142 targets related", "142 enhanced levels", "restricts ebv entry", "support viral infection", "infected bl cells", "cells using anti", "ebv lytic phase", "erk signaling initiated", "ebv reactivation", "mapk signaling", "lytic stage", "ig antibodies", "induce reactivation", "ebv latency", "taken together", "significant role", "results show", "latency plays", "key regulator", "immediate early", "grna library", "genetic ablation", "gain insight", "fully understood", "effects could", "dabrafenib ).", "clip experiments", "burkitt lymphoma", "based screen", "barr virus"], "keywords": [